.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_CIPHER-CAST 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_CIPHER-CAST
.Nd The CAST EVP_CIPHER implementations
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for CAST symmetric encryption using the
.Sy EVP_CIPHER
API.
.Ss Algorithm Names
The following algorithms are available in the legacy provider:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqCAST-128-CBC", \(dqCAST-192-CBC" and \(dqCAST-256-CBC"
.It \(dqCAST-128-CFB", \(dqCAST-192-CFB", \(dqCAST-256-CFB"
.It \(dqCAST-128-ECB", \(dqCAST-192-ECB" and \(dqCAST-256-ECB"
.It \(dqCAST-192-OFB", \(dqCAST-128-OFB" and \(dqCAST-256-OFB"
.El
.Ss Parameters
This implementation supports the parameters described in
.Xr EVP_EncryptInit 3 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr provider-cipher 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-legacy 7
